<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria sells 9.88 bln levs 1-wk discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria sells 9.88 bln levs 1-wk discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's finance ministry on Friday sold 9,879 million levs of one-week discount T-bills, yielding 3.69 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Bids were received for a total of 10.129 billion levs of T-bills but the ministry approved bids for 9.879 billion levs.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3013297000</p>
<p> Term			    one week</p>
<p> Auction date		  January 31, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date		    January 31, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		 February 7, 1997</p>
<p> Bids received		 10,129.3 million levs</p>
<p> Avg price of bids	   96.43 pct</p>
<p> Bids approved		 9,879.3 million levs</p>
<p> Avg accepted price	  96.44 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     3.69 pct @</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
